{"parse":{"title":"2026年9月24日维护内容","pageid":9156,"revid":22362,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B49%E6%9C%8824%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B49%E6%9C%8824%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B49%E6%9C%8824%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E8%B5%84%E8%AE%AF\" title=\"铃兰资讯\">铃兰资讯</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4\" title=\"维护\">维护</a> &gt; <b>2026年9月24日维护内容</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E3.80.8A.E9.93.83.E5.85.B0.E4.B9.8B.E5.89.91.E3.80.8B9.E6.9C.8824.E6.97.A5.E7.BB.B4.E6.8A.A4.E5.86.85.E5.AE.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"《铃兰之剑》9月24日维护内容\">《铃兰之剑》9月24日维护内容</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=2026%E5%B9%B49%E6%9C%8824%E6%97%A5%E7%BB%B4%E6%8A%A4%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：《铃兰之剑》9月24日维护内容\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：TapTap<br /><b>原作者</b>：努力上班的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2026/09/23<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.taptap.cn%2Fmoment%2F851045810446534195\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.taptap.cn/moment/851045810446534195</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px; opacity:0.8; margin-top:20px; margin: 20px 0 -15px 0; font-weight: normal; margin-left:0px;\"><img alt=\"笔记.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/40px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/60px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/4tfw9hhcf4do0mjejj67xr9so5959oe.png/80px-%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />【更新内容】</div><br />\n<p>1.重逢之时：<b>翠斯坦&amp;莉拉</b><br />\n▶︎活动时间：<br />\n2026/09/25 12:00 - 2026/10/08 23:59<br />\n▶︎活动说明：<br />\n活动期间，角色「翠斯坦」、「莉拉」的邂逅获取概率将大幅提升。<br />\n<br />\n2.「星海的奏鸣」活动限时开启<br />\n▶︎活动时间：<br />\n2026/09/25 00:00 - 2026/10/01 23:59<br />\n▶︎活动说明：<br />\n活动期间，「塔罗遗力」、「光辉锻铸」的每日高额奖励次数+1。<br />\n<br />\n3.丰饶之角「秋之华章」限时开启<br />\n▶︎活动时间：<br />\n2026/09/28 00:00 - 2026/10/25 11:59<br />\n▶︎活动说明：<br />\n「丰饶之角」活动开启后，提升丰饶等级即可获得奖励。可通过解锁「丰收的祝词」或「丰收的赞歌」，获取更丰厚的奖励。<br />\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n【审判之日】修复了「突袭要塞」关卡中「巨流之锤」在第5回合前无法被击败的问题。<br />\n【系统】修复了「光辉术师\"圣眷\"」「光辉禁军\"铁卫\"」羁绊2级专属头像未正常发放的问题。<br />\n【系统】修复了「乐土」中触发与「萨曼莎」的战斗后，「萨曼莎」可能消失的问题。<br />\n【显示】调整了「露卡玛尔」外观「神国焚影」及「阿加塔」外观「海岛之梦」的部分美术表现，针对已经拥有这两款外观的团长，后续将有补偿方案，请关注官方后续公告。<br />\n【战斗】修复了「安缇歌」的被动技能「认知错乱」在受到「禁止被动技能」效果影响时仍可能正常触发的问题。<br />\n【战斗】修复了部分情况下方向性警戒技能转向后，警戒范围未跟随转向的问题。\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022101137\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 89/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1917/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 234/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   33.345      1 -total\n 62.88%   20.966      1 模板:面包屑\n 36.83%   12.281      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:9156-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022101137 and revision id 22362. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"维护","missing":true}],"images":["笔记.png","官方消息175.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"《铃兰之剑》9月24日维护内容","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"2026年9月24日维护内容","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"《铃兰之剑》9月24日维护内容"}],"displaytitle":"2026年9月24日维护内容","wikitext":"{{面包屑|铃兰资讯|维护}}\n=《铃兰之剑》9月24日维护内容=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=维护\n|时间=2026/09/23\n|作者=努力上班的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=TapTap\n|原文地址=https://www.taptap.cn/moment/851045810446534195\n}}\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<div style=\"font-